            "review_title": "Review at Banh Cuon Gia Truyen Thanh Van",
            "review_text": "Noa M\n2 contributions\n2\nBest pork pancake\nApr 2024 • Couples\nMe and my girlfriend was here and ate their Banh cuon, a rice flour pancake. And I tried their pork version and it was amazing. My girlfriend is vegetarian and even if they didn’t offered a veggie option they made a pancake without the meat so we could share the experience! Maybe not the best place for vegetarians but highly recommend it for meat eaters! :)\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten April 9, 2024",
